    description: "Follow-up from WI-zakub mini trial (notebookjournal_04172026_0210.md). On ripgrep, 0/14295 SymbolInformation records carried any relationship entry — the descriptor string carries trait-impl info (impl#[T][Trait]method()) but SymbolInformation.relationships is always empty. Check: workspace-member crate, nightly, explicit workspace top-level. If ever populated, SCIP ingest shim should prefer relationships over descriptor parsing when present."  # 2ad3
