  clock: 3  # 1e0d
  nonce: 1e0d  # 1e0d
  message: "Closed 2026-04-17 based on accumulating evidence from WI-zakub (default config, 14295 symbols, 0 relationships) + WI-ronot (procMacro.enable=true + procMacro.attributes.enable=true + cargo.buildScripts.enable=true, same 14295 symbols, still 0 relationships). Two configs × workspace with 7 crates × ripgrep's full workspace-member setup = strong signal that rust-analyzer 1.94's SCIP exporter simply does not populate SymbolInformation.relationships for the kinds of inputs hypergumbo will encounter. SCIP integration shim should proceed assuming descriptor-only parsing (already captured in WI-bajuz and WI-mafut designs). If a future rust-analyzer release starts populating relationships, the shim can opportunistically prefer them — but that's additive, not a prerequisite. Diminishing returns from further config sweeps here; unblock downstream work instead."  # 1e0d
